  "description": "REA MCGEE ARE PLEASED TO PRESENT THIS FANTASTIC APARTMENT TO LET IN THE EVER-POPULAR AREA OF COLLINS AVENUE. This property features a living room, fitted kitchen, a double bedroom, an office, and a bathroom. This is an excellent letting opportunity as the area boasts several bus routes and is in close proximity to access the city centre. This is a mature area and has an excellent selection of local shops & schools, which are just a stone throw away. There is also easy access to shopping centres at the Omni Park and Artane Castle, Beaumont Hospital, close to D.C.U. and Dublin Airport. Viewing is highly recommended, by appointment only. PLEASE REPLY BY EMAIL ONLY, WITH YOUR MOBILE PHONE NUMBER, AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU TO ARRANGE A VIEWING.",
